   "text": "Example Dialogue"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "A：みきちゃんが洋介と別れたんだって。 A: I heard that Miki-chan broke up with Yousuke."
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "B：ということは、みきちゃんは、今彼氏がいないということ？ B: Does that mean Miki-chan doesn't have a boyfriend now?"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "A：そう。そういうこと。 A: That's right. That's what it means."
  },
